WEBVTT

00:13.228 --> 00:15.731
Akane... I'm back...
is what I'd like to say, however...

00:15.814 --> 00:22.654
I actually have to go on a long journey,
right away. Don't ask why. I won't say.

00:22.738 --> 00:29.703
Although there is...
one thing I can tell you.

00:31.496 --> 00:35.417
The next time we meet, Akane I am going
to be a complete man again! So please,

00:35.500 --> 00:40.922
will, you go out- out- out- out.

00:41.423 --> 00:42.507
BLUSH

00:43.008 --> 00:44.301
Aaah! Come on!

00:44.384 --> 00:45.218
SHIVER SHIVER

00:45.302 --> 00:48.930
Oh I can't even say it!
I'm too embarrassed!

00:49.556 --> 00:52.100
Hey you! Get back here you dirty old man!

00:52.726 --> 00:54.811
Wonderful! What a feast for the eyes!

00:55.520 --> 00:56.772
Somebody catch him!

01:04.321 --> 01:07.074
Dammit! For an old pervy
geezer he's really quick!

01:07.157 --> 01:09.326
He keeps coming to our school every day.

01:09.826 --> 01:12.954
We gotta do more than just chase him
every time he makes a move!

01:13.038 --> 01:15.332
Tell us what you've got in mind,
Akane, we're all in!

01:15.415 --> 01:18.543
Listen up! Ok, how about this...
So everyone has gym class tomorrow,

01:18.627 --> 01:20.587
correct? Alright...

01:21.088 --> 01:22.547
SQUISH

01:23.131 --> 01:26.551
Ryoga? What are you doing here?
We're in the middle of a meeting.

01:26.635 --> 01:27.803
Hey.

01:30.222 --> 01:36.061
RANMA 1/2

01:38.438 --> 01:39.397
EAT QUIETLY!

01:48.782 --> 01:50.784
DAD

01:51.660 --> 01:53.495
RANMA

01:54.079 --> 01:56.790
AKANE

02:58.977 --> 03:01.730
So you're gonna be traveling
somewhere again, Ryoga?

03:03.356 --> 03:06.276
Yes. I don't know when I'll be back.

03:06.943 --> 03:09.529
You should go and see Ranma.
It's been a while.

03:10.030 --> 03:12.115
I have nothing to say to that guy!

03:12.199 --> 03:13.200
I see.

03:15.785 --> 03:18.788
But despite everything.
You two are good friends, aren't you?

03:18.872 --> 03:22.834
You know what they say, "The more
you fight someone, the closer you get!"

03:24.127 --> 03:25.503
Never mind that, Akane!

03:34.221 --> 03:35.722
Um... When I...

03:36.223 --> 03:37.057
Yes?

03:37.140 --> 03:39.809
Well- When I eventually get back,
will you...

03:40.393 --> 03:41.228
Will I...?

03:41.895 --> 03:44.272
Will... will... will... will...

03:45.523 --> 03:46.858
Will you accept this gift!

03:47.359 --> 03:52.280
Wow! You already got me a souvenir!
You're such a nice guy, Ryoga! Thanks!

03:55.116 --> 03:57.494
Bye! Take care, I'll see you soon!

03:59.871 --> 04:00.705
Agh!

04:00.789 --> 04:03.291
DON'T BREAK THE WALL
SMASH SMASH SMASH SMASH SMASH

04:03.375 --> 04:04.209
- Dammit!
- Ryoga?

04:04.292 --> 04:07.963
- Oh. Akane?
- Let me give you... A goodbye kiss.

04:10.173 --> 04:11.049
But... Akane... We haven't...

04:11.132 --> 04:18.056
Even held hands or anything yet- Wait,
hold on! I'm not ready for this...

04:19.432 --> 04:20.976
Okay then I won't.

04:22.269 --> 04:23.687
THUD WHACK CRACK

04:25.188 --> 04:28.942
Oh man, you're pretty rough. Y'know
we haven't seen each other in ages?

04:29.025 --> 04:32.487
Whatever, shut up. Keep your
stupid nose out of my love life.

04:33.738 --> 04:35.782
What are you mad about, P-Chan?

04:36.324 --> 04:37.158
Heh.

04:38.076 --> 04:38.994
SQUISH

04:39.869 --> 04:44.541
I'm sorry to say, Ranma... You'll be
saying goodbye to P-Chan pretty soon.

04:45.834 --> 04:49.379
- Huh?
- And it's all thanks, to this thing here!

04:49.879 --> 04:53.383
Oh cool, is it a map?
Is it a treasure map?!

04:53.883 --> 04:58.013
Idiot! Give it back!
You... damn... bastard... come here!

04:59.931 --> 05:00.765
Ah...

05:04.102 --> 05:04.936
Oh no!

05:06.813 --> 05:09.733
It's the Japanese Spring of Drowned Man!

05:15.488 --> 05:18.533
Huh?! There's actually
a Japanese Spring of Drowned Man?

05:22.287 --> 05:24.497
A long time ago,
in the province of Musashi...

05:24.581 --> 05:27.792
The villagers were troubled by
a pack of very mischievous foxes.

05:27.876 --> 05:30.503
One day, a high priest,
who was visiting from China,

05:30.587 --> 05:33.840
struck the ground with his staff.
And a spring immediately gushed

05:33.923 --> 05:36.343
forth from the ground.
As soon as that happened,

05:36.426 --> 05:39.095
the mischievous foxes
who were bathing in the spring,

05:39.179 --> 05:42.807
all suddenly and mysteriously transformed
into men. As a result of that,

05:42.891 --> 05:48.688
not one mischievous fox
remained in the area. However, it is said

05:48.772 --> 05:55.737
that the people suffered
an even greater inconvenience...

05:58.365 --> 06:01.785
Wow, then I guess it's true.
That must be the Spring of Drowned Man.

06:03.912 --> 06:07.207
SPRING OF DROWNED MAN

06:10.543 --> 06:11.544
Huh?

06:12.670 --> 06:15.590
So that's it. That's where I'm heading.

06:16.716 --> 06:19.552
Huh? Hey, wait, hold up one second, Ryoga!

06:20.595 --> 06:22.722
Team up? Don't be ridiculous!

06:23.223 --> 06:26.142
No, listen you idiot,
I'm saying I'll take you there!

06:26.226 --> 06:29.687
I don't need your help. After all,
I've got this map to guide me.

06:30.188 --> 06:32.649
A pig reading a map? Yeah
good luck with that.

06:34.192 --> 06:37.654
Y'know I might even miss it.
You won't be able to call me a pig soon.

06:37.737 --> 06:39.197
Makes me kinda sad.

06:43.410 --> 06:46.287
Hey! You know that's a dead end, right?

06:48.581 --> 06:50.792
I'll get there eventually
if I keep walking!

06:50.875 --> 06:54.129
After all, the Japanese Spring of
Drowned Man is waiting for me!

06:55.630 --> 06:58.341
Come on, man.
Just let me take a little peek at it.

06:58.425 --> 07:01.553
Hah! I'm going to return
a complete man all by myself.

07:01.636 --> 07:05.932
Oh it's this way, you idiot...
You were going the wrong way all along.

07:06.558 --> 07:08.476
You bastard! Give it!

07:10.353 --> 07:12.355
All rise. Bow!

07:12.981 --> 07:14.941
Alright, it's time for gym class.

07:15.024 --> 07:17.193
That dirty old geezer is gonna
try to mess with us again.

07:17.277 --> 07:18.486
I don't wanna be here right now.

07:18.570 --> 07:20.488
- I just wanna go home.
- So gross.

07:20.572 --> 07:23.366
Don't worry.
There's no way he'll bother us any more.

07:23.867 --> 07:26.119
Akane! What're you gonna do?

07:26.202 --> 07:27.328
Don't worry about it.

07:33.334 --> 07:34.169
Hey, Ranma.

07:34.252 --> 07:38.089
Are you sure this is the right place?
This is just the back of the school.

07:38.173 --> 07:40.508
This is the place, I'm sure of it.
According to the map,

07:40.592 --> 07:44.637
the Inari shrine is a really important
clue in finding the location of-

07:44.721 --> 07:46.806
Thanks. For showing me the way!

07:48.933 --> 07:52.353
Right so I make one hundred steps in
the direction that the fox is pointing.

07:52.437 --> 07:54.981
Then I'll be at the Japanese
Spring of Drowned Man!

07:55.064 --> 07:56.232
MHAHAHAHA

07:56.983 --> 07:58.610
- Wait up you bastard!
- Huh?

07:59.486 --> 08:00.570
Stop following me!

08:01.613 --> 08:04.991
You're such a coward! You really
wanna get ahead of me that badly?!

08:05.867 --> 08:08.036
Shut up! You're just after a free ride!

08:08.745 --> 08:10.788
Hey, I showed you the way! Idiot!

08:10.872 --> 08:14.459
Eighty-four, eighty-five, eighty-six!
It must be under that building there!

08:14.542 --> 08:16.669
Ninety-two, ninety-three, ninety-four!

08:29.098 --> 08:30.225
BAM

08:30.308 --> 08:31.684
CRASH

08:31.768 --> 08:32.727
SNAP CRUNCH

08:32.810 --> 08:35.230
KABOOM

08:39.817 --> 08:43.279
- Oh no! That old geezer isn't here!
- Do you think this is gonna work?

08:43.363 --> 08:44.614
- He got away!
- So then that means...

08:44.697 --> 08:47.325
- Let's see...
- He'll definitely be back!

08:47.408 --> 08:50.453
- Then we're gonna fight him to the end!
- I'm gonna help you out, Akane!

08:50.537 --> 08:51.746
That guy's gonna pay.

08:51.829 --> 08:54.249
- Ninety-eight, ninety-nine, one hundred!
- Me too!

08:54.332 --> 08:56.376
It's... Under the girls locker room?!

08:56.459 --> 08:59.003
The Japanese Spring of
Drowned Man is there?!

08:59.087 --> 09:02.048
Yep, no doubt. Dammit.
I need to get there no matter what!

09:02.131 --> 09:06.886
There's absolutely no way
we can back down now!

09:06.970 --> 09:08.596
Let's work together!

09:11.140 --> 09:12.642
Alright, so is everyone ready?

09:12.725 --> 09:15.937
We're going to defend the girls'
locker room no matter what!

09:16.437 --> 09:17.480
Yeah!

09:18.356 --> 09:20.858
- And one two, and one two,
- And one two, and one two, and one two,

09:20.942 --> 09:22.443
and one two, and one two,

09:22.527 --> 09:25.113
Excuse me, master. Aren't you
going to visit the school again today?

09:25.196 --> 09:28.199
- One two, and one two, and one two,
- And one two, one two, and one two,

09:28.992 --> 09:32.745
Alright, ready! This'll be easy.
I'll just pretend to be a girl.

09:33.246 --> 09:37.417
Ranma, you bastard! Your plan is just to
go straight into the girls locker room?

09:37.500 --> 09:38.668
Of course!

09:38.751 --> 09:42.380
What!? I won't allow it!
Especially as Akane is changing in there!

09:42.463 --> 09:45.550
Hey now. Don't you forget
that we both have a common goal!

09:45.633 --> 09:49.762
The Spring of Drowned Man is right
under the girls' locker room!

09:50.805 --> 09:51.723
Oh no!

09:52.223 --> 09:53.099
Ugh.

09:53.182 --> 09:56.060
Hey. Do you think that old man
will really come back?

09:56.144 --> 09:57.228
I know he will!

09:57.312 --> 09:58.146
I hope not

09:58.229 --> 10:02.066
Today, we have to teach that pervy geezer
a lesson he will never ever forget!

10:02.150 --> 10:04.319
We'll never be able to change in
peace again at this rate.

10:04.402 --> 10:06.738
- Oh no! I accidentally forgot something!
- Yeah

10:07.322 --> 10:08.156
Huh?!

10:10.575 --> 10:14.412
You idiot! Did you forget we're using
a password before coming in here!

10:15.079 --> 10:16.164
Whoops, sorry my bad!

10:16.247 --> 10:21.127
It totally slipped my mind! Right...
Spring of Drowned Man, where are you...?

10:22.211 --> 10:24.172
Ranma! What are you doing?!

10:24.255 --> 10:26.215
Shh! The direction was right.
Now... the distance is...

10:26.299 --> 10:29.302
It has to be around here somewhere...

10:29.385 --> 10:31.804
Huh? W-what's going on?

10:32.764 --> 10:36.267
- Why you, shameless little perv!
- No! No, it's... no! Time out! Time out!

10:36.351 --> 10:38.144
Akane!
You shouldn't be so rough with her!

10:38.227 --> 10:39.854
Whoa there. Calm down...
whoa now... whoa whoa...

10:39.937 --> 10:42.315
- Are you okay?
- Th... that was mean, Akane.

10:42.398 --> 10:43.775
Huh?! What the hell...

10:44.275 --> 10:46.069
No one here has noticed who I am.

10:46.152 --> 10:49.280
That was so smart
of me to come in disguise.

10:49.364 --> 10:50.782
Hurry up and get outta here!

10:50.865 --> 10:54.827
Oh! Do you honestly have a problem with a
girl being in the girls' locker room-

10:55.578 --> 10:57.955
If you don't want me to
expose you right here...

10:59.749 --> 11:01.209
Then get out!

11:01.709 --> 11:03.628
You're so violent!

11:03.711 --> 11:05.129
Stay out! Peeping Tom!

11:05.630 --> 11:07.048
Whoa! Huh!

11:09.217 --> 11:11.928
Ha! I'm not turning back into
a guy dressed like this!

11:16.182 --> 11:19.060
Oh look! It's Ranma Saotome
from the class next door!

11:19.644 --> 11:20.978
Look at his underwear!

11:21.062 --> 11:21.938
What's he doing!?

11:25.775 --> 11:26.609
Dammit!

11:28.986 --> 11:29.987
You deserved that.

11:30.071 --> 11:34.450
You idiot! How can you be so
calm at a time like this!?

11:37.412 --> 11:41.290
Dammit! I'm gonna do whatever
it takes to be a man again!

11:42.834 --> 11:43.668
Listen, Ryoga.

11:44.752 --> 11:46.713
Go in, steal some clothes and run away.

11:46.796 --> 11:50.299
Then while Akane and the girls are
chasing you, I'll dig up the Spring

11:50.383 --> 11:56.097
of Japanese Drowned Man! Got it?
Just shut up and do it already!

11:58.516 --> 12:00.768
Oh wow! Look it's P-Chan!

12:00.852 --> 12:01.853
Cute!

12:01.936 --> 12:02.895
P-Chan?

12:07.150 --> 12:09.652
Where have you
been all this time, P-Chan?

12:20.371 --> 12:21.664
His nose! It's bleeding!

12:21.748 --> 12:23.082
No, P-Chan?!

12:33.718 --> 12:35.636
Wake up! You bastard!

12:39.974 --> 12:42.059
So sorry... as you were...

12:48.107 --> 12:53.905
I'm so glad to be alive.
Maybe being a pig... isn't so bad...

12:54.447 --> 12:56.240
What the hell are you talking about!?

12:56.324 --> 13:00.161
What's more important, short-term
happiness or the Spring of Drowned Man?!

13:00.244 --> 13:01.954
Short-term happiness.

13:02.914 --> 13:05.583
Ranma's such a jerk.
He's always quick to run away.

13:06.209 --> 13:08.586
Oh? Ryoga? I thought you were traveling?

13:10.171 --> 13:14.091
Oh, Akane! So, thanks for, earlier...

13:16.469 --> 13:18.262
What?! Ranma was peeping?

13:18.763 --> 13:22.141
I know, right?!
I'm so disappointed in him.

13:22.767 --> 13:27.021
You leave Ranma to me. As a fellow
man, there's no way I can let this slide!

13:27.522 --> 13:31.025
Thank you! I already feel
better knowing that you're here, Ryoga!

13:31.108 --> 13:34.320
Well... if I can help out in any way,
Akane, you know I will.

13:34.403 --> 13:35.321
Tch!

13:35.404 --> 13:36.239
Thanks, again!

13:37.073 --> 13:39.242
Like hell I'm gonna
give up on that Spring!

13:40.076 --> 13:42.870
- Alright!
- Looks like there's no one here.

13:45.081 --> 13:46.332
Huh? Whoa!

13:49.210 --> 13:51.128
Wh... What the hell is this?

13:53.923 --> 13:56.342
Looks like I caught you, underwear thief!

13:56.425 --> 14:01.639
Gah! Ryoga, you bastard... What happened
to the Spring of Drowned Man, huh?

14:01.722 --> 14:06.269
This is for Akane! I'm gonna teach you
a lesson, you enemy of women!

14:06.352 --> 14:08.187
Yeah? Well you're a traitor of men!

14:09.730 --> 14:10.565
There!

14:14.151 --> 14:16.404
- That'll keep him down for a while.
- It's you.

14:16.487 --> 14:20.992
What a haul! Oh, a wonderful mountain of
treasure! Hey, do you want in on this?

14:21.492 --> 14:23.035
Huh? Wait a second!

14:23.119 --> 14:25.079
So, that's what this was all about...

14:27.665 --> 14:30.918
You were in cahoots with the
pervy geezer after all, weren't you?

14:39.385 --> 14:42.930
Hey, listen, Ranma. We should
join forces to get the treasure!

14:43.431 --> 14:45.892
What?!? No way! You perv.

14:49.270 --> 14:52.189
Alright. Come at me from anywhere, Ranma!

14:53.816 --> 14:55.318
You'd better get ready, Akane.

14:55.401 --> 15:00.948
I'm gonna do whatever I have to to make
sure I get into the girls' locker room!

15:01.449 --> 15:04.619
Well said, Ranma.
You're willing to go far for underwea--

15:05.328 --> 15:07.955
It's for the Spring of Drowned Man!
And you, gramps...

15:08.039 --> 15:13.461
You're gonna help me get there.
Great! You look gross.

15:13.544 --> 15:14.587
Ribbit.

15:16.297 --> 15:17.882
Time to ramp things up!

15:20.551 --> 15:23.137
Hey, everyone, calm down!
They're just stupid toys!

15:23.638 --> 15:29.268
Oh no look! Snakes! And frogs!
They're all real and scary!

15:29.769 --> 15:30.978
Ranma!

15:32.063 --> 15:33.940
- Here!
- Ribbit.

15:36.400 --> 15:37.485
Ribbit, ribbit!

15:38.319 --> 15:41.238
Huh? Ranma...!

15:48.371 --> 15:49.205
Pervert!

15:57.213 --> 15:58.047
Huh?!

15:58.130 --> 16:03.427
Dammit, I've been found out already?!
I thought my disguise was perfect!

16:04.261 --> 16:06.472
Sorry! I honestly thought you were Ranma!

16:06.973 --> 16:11.686
Huh? Ouch! How could you! What did I ever
do to you to deserve that!

16:12.186 --> 16:16.107
Oh! I'm sorry! I'm so sorry I really am!

16:17.775 --> 16:18.609
But...

16:22.571 --> 16:24.198
- Huh?
- I love you!

16:24.281 --> 16:27.910
What?! Hey, hang on!
This is the first time we've met...

16:28.411 --> 16:31.163
Do you not like girls with glasses,
is that it??

16:31.247 --> 16:35.334
Uh, no that's not it...
There's just, someone I like...

16:35.418 --> 16:37.003
It's okay I don't mind!

16:37.086 --> 16:39.463
Well, I guess... if you say so...

16:40.923 --> 16:42.008
Now go to sleep!

16:42.633 --> 16:44.260
What do you think you're doing!?

16:44.844 --> 16:45.678
A-Akane!

16:45.761 --> 16:49.598
It's all a misunderstanding, Akane!
It's not what you think it is, honestly-

16:53.102 --> 16:57.231
Ranma, you really want underwear so badly
that you'd do something so embarrassing?

16:58.524 --> 17:00.818
GRIND GRIND GRIND

17:02.028 --> 17:02.862
Huh?

17:02.945 --> 17:05.656
I'll give you all the underwear.
Those from earlier were just decoys.

17:05.740 --> 17:08.576
These are the real ones.

17:09.326 --> 17:10.161
Hey, listen!

17:10.244 --> 17:14.790
So please, for me. I'm begging you.
Please, no more crimes against women.

17:14.874 --> 17:21.505
I honestly never believed that you
would do something like this. Goodbye!

17:22.006 --> 17:25.551
Wait! I'm searching for the
Spring of Drowned Man you idiot!

17:27.678 --> 17:30.389
You're doing what?
You think the Spring of Drowned Man

17:30.473 --> 17:35.644
is under the girls' locker room?
Is that what it is, Ranma?

17:36.145 --> 17:38.606
Come on,
do you really think I'd lie to you?

17:38.689 --> 17:40.024
If you're gonna lie,

17:40.107 --> 17:41.484
make it something believable!

17:41.567 --> 17:42.443
CRACK...

17:42.526 --> 17:46.280
You did a good job of disguising yourself
earlier, Ranma. Heh. That's right.

17:46.363 --> 17:51.994
I have never properly gone out with a
girl, not even once in my life.

17:53.746 --> 17:56.248
So as for someone confessing
their feelings for me...

17:56.332 --> 18:00.002
That's never happened to me!
Not in my entire life!

18:00.711 --> 18:01.712
That's... so sad.

18:02.213 --> 18:03.214
Poor guy.

18:05.132 --> 18:06.509
Alright, so what?

18:07.635 --> 18:13.516
I need you to tell me... Ranma... Why would
you do something so ridiculous to me!?

18:14.308 --> 18:17.269
Do I need to remind you?
The Spring of Drowned Man...

18:17.353 --> 18:19.146
Oh right, so that's it then...

18:21.690 --> 18:23.526
That's what you did all of this for...

18:23.609 --> 18:27.196
You trampled over my pure feelings
again and again for what?!

18:27.696 --> 18:30.116
Shut up!
What the hell are you talking about?!

18:30.199 --> 18:34.495
You're the one who brought the map to the
Spring of Drowned Man in the first place!

18:35.121 --> 18:35.955
Huh?

18:38.249 --> 18:39.458
Ryoga? Is what he's saying true?

18:39.542 --> 18:44.713
I don't understand. Why would
you have that map on you though?

18:44.797 --> 18:45.631
Huh?

18:48.259 --> 18:50.928
Don't tell me! Wait could it be that you...

19:09.155 --> 19:10.698
She... figured it out!

19:11.198 --> 19:15.911
You're trying to help cure Ranma's
condition! You're such a nice guy!

19:17.413 --> 19:20.040
You're lucky that Akane is so dense,
P-Chan.

19:24.920 --> 19:30.634
Who are you calliing... P-Chan? Huh?!?

19:32.553 --> 19:34.054
Breaking...!

19:34.555 --> 19:36.807
Whoa!
Watch where you're aiming that thing!

19:36.891 --> 19:38.809
Point!

19:55.576 --> 19:57.578
Wait, I hear something!

20:03.709 --> 20:04.710
You did it!

20:16.764 --> 20:21.393
It exists...
The Japanese Spring of Drowned Man!

20:22.519 --> 20:23.354
Hey.

20:24.313 --> 20:26.815
You're certain that map
was to the location of the

20:26.899 --> 20:30.861
Japanese Spring of Drowned Man, right?
Then how come we both still transformed?

20:30.945 --> 20:34.531
Say something you stupid pig!

20:39.828 --> 20:40.663
Huh?

